{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive together on a <i>mysterious island</i> by gathering rare ores and resources for crafting and progression. Climb to the <i>signal tower</i> atop the mountain to establish contact with the observers on the distant isle. Face strange creatures born from frequency interference while uncovering the island\u2019s secrets. Cooperate in co-op: <strong>build</strong>, <strong>upgrade</strong>, and <strong>forge</strong> the ultimate plan to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you uncover the truth, or lose yourselves to the madness?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339820/extras/SeparatorLine.png?t=1773686319\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339820/extras/BulletPoint1.png?t=1773686319\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Survive the nightmare together in an immersive, story-driven co-op adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339820/extras/BulletPoint2.png?t=1773686319\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Face tense challenges with real-time decisions that could lead to life... or madness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339820/extras/BulletPoint3.png?t=1773686319\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a0- Realistic mechanics like limited communication, friendly fire and gas masks heighten the terror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339820/extras/BulletPoint4.png?t=1773686319\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Carefully designed to perform well across a range of hardware, with quality options to fit your setup.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339820/extras/BulletPoint5.png?t=1773686319\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Expect moments that will leave your heart racing, but don't let the fear cloud your judgment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339820/extras/BulletPoint6.png?t=1773686319\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- There's no winning without your partner. Teamwork is your only chance at Survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339820/extras/BulletPoint7.png?t=1773686319\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- A grounded horror experience with no Sci-Fi Dimensions, just the dark secrets of a world gone wrong.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339820/extras/BulletPoint8.png?t=1773686319\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- A compact yet unforgettable experience designed for an evening of terror.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3339820?t=1773686319","background_raw":"https://stor